# Trivy ignore file: every entry needs a reason and an expiry condition.
# Format: one CVE/check ID per line, `#` comments allowed. Entries here
# suppress ONLY the listed finding; everything else still fails the build
# (HIGH/CRITICAL, fixed vulnerabilities only).
#
# EMPTY BY DESIGN. The former DS-0002 (Dockerfiles ran as root) exception
# was removed on 2026-10-17 once both runtime images declared a non-root
# USER (task 1.6 batch 3, commits for the multi-stage Dockerfiles). The
# filesystem gate must stay red if any image regresses to root.
